20,"text":"weich","voiceRole":"male","pos":"adjective","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":21,"text":"die Espressokanne","voiceRole":"female","pos":"noun","gender":"f","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":21,"text":"die Espressokanne","voiceRole":"male","pos":"noun","gender":"f","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1"},{"section":"reading","type":"reading-passage","idx":1,"text":"Alles was man in diesem Stadtteil sieht ist überraschend Der Ort wo die meisten Graffiti gesprüht wurden liegt gleich hinter dem Brunnen Das Kunstwerk an der Betonwand ist das Beste was Besucher je entdeckt haben Das Café in dem Besucher sich ausruhen können serviert auch guten Kaffee","authoredText":"Alles, was man in diesem Stadtteil sieht, ist überraschend. Der Ort, wo die meisten Graffiti gesprüht wurden, liegt gleich hinter dem Brunnen. Das Kunstwerk an der Betonwand ist das Beste, was Besucher je entdeckt haben. Das Café, in dem Besucher sich ausruhen können, serviert auch guten Kaffee.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Ein Stadtteil voller Kunst","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Renke, wohin soll ich meine Schwester bringen, wo es wirklich sehenswert ist?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_032_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Bring sie in den Stadtteil, wo die ganze Straßenkunst ist.","speaker":"Renke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_032_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Das liebt sie bestimmt.","speaker":"Renke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_032_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Gute Idee, das ist genau das, was sie sich immer gewünscht hat.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_032_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Und was mir am meisten gefällt, ist die kleine Galerie an der Ecke.","speaker":"Renke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_032_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Renke, wohin soll ich meine Schwester bringen, wo es wirklich sehenswert ist?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_032_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Bring sie in den Stadtteil, wo die ganze Straßenkunst ist. Das liebt sie bestimmt.","speaker":"Renke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_032_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Gute Idee, das ist genau das, was sie sich immer gewünscht hat.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_032_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Und was mir am meisten gefällt, ist die kleine Galerie an der Ecke.","speaker":"Renke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_032_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Bring sie in den Stadtteil, wo die ganze Straßenkunst ist.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Ein Freund fragt, wohin er seine Schwester bringen soll.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Das, was ihr am besten gefällt, sind die Graffiti an der Betonwand.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Er fragt, was ihr besonders gefallen wird.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Das ist der Platz, wo der alte Brunnen steht.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Eine Kollegin fragt nach dem Brunnen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Was mich anregt, sind Kunstwerke im Freien.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-32-relativsaetze-was-wo","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"Deine Freundin fragt, was dich an Kunst anregt.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Ich bin am liebsten dort, wo es ruhig und weich ist.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control"